# external/ held a hand-made RAEv2 clone. The fork the RAE generators need is now
# tracked under packages/peal-xai-rae (CC BY-NC 4.0, see LICENSING.md); external/
# stays ignored for older setups that still point $PEAL_RAEV2_DIR there.
external/

# Packaging output (setup.py sdist/bdist_wheel)
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
REPRO_REPORT_old.md
.agent

# The CC BY-NC RAEv2 fork (packages/peal-xai-rae) must be tracked in full. Its
# src/utils/ and src/eval/datasets.py match the bare `utils` and `datasets*`
# rules above, which would silently drop 12 source files from every commit.
# Caches and build output inside it stay ignored.
!packages/peal-xai-rae/**
packages/peal-xai-rae/**/__pycache__/
packages/peal-xai-rae/**/*.py[cod]
packages/peal-xai-rae/**/.caches/
packages/peal-xai-rae/build/
packages/peal-xai-rae/*.egg-info/
